## Acceptance boundary

Accept corrected episode 5102 into the training split. It is a unique, strictly valid, event-free
episode with a frozen configuration and reproduces the causal parameter-regime target. Together,
5101 and 5102 provide 286 no-history and 280 four-history examples; this remains too little to train
or claim generalization. Validation and test episodes remain unused.
